Z||000006||Jay in Atlanta||08-11-2001||08:15 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Monkeyman:<BR><B>And shouldn't "Drive Your Fiero To Work Day" be on the 12<sup>th</sup> if that's the day the last Fiero drove off the assembly line?<P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Do you go to work on Sunday?  Drive your Fiero to work day has to be a weekday for most people.  Otherwise, I'd agree with you as a purist.<P>~Jay||||reg||1
